# behavior: `oven inspect interop-plan --target TRIPLE` prints the selected target's requirements: its toolchain and SDK capabilities, its platform fact, its definitions and the system artifacts it needs, as 0.5's plan carried them (#3135)
# cli-commands:
#   oven inspect interop-plan --target aarch64-apple-ios
# expect-stdout:
#   target aarch64-apple-ios
#   project interop_plan_requirements
#     toolchain apple-clang >=17
#     sdk iphoneos >=18, <28
#     platform ios 13.0
#     definition BRIDGE_MOBILE=1
#     system artifact foundation: apple.framework.Foundation
#     header interop/include/bridge.h

